  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/description",
    "raw": "The Seekers",
    "value": "探索者"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Skath appoint the brightest and quickest on their feet as Seekers. This caste, responsible for seeking out new inhabitable spawn worlds as well as knowledge, are the scientific and educational branch of the Skathian people. Without the Seeker caste, all progress would come to a halt.",
    "value": "海鳞族将最聪慧敏捷的个体选为探索者。此阶层负责探寻新的宜居繁衍世界与知识，是海鳞族中专注于科学与教育的分支。若无探索者，一切进步都将停滞。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The primary mission of the Seeker caste is the betterment of Skathian life, even at the expense of other lives. Experimentation on other bipedal species is rarely off-the-table (in fact, most research *starts* here for the Skath) and is one of the primary reasons they were not permitted to join the Protectorate. They have instead joined the League of Non-Aligned Worlds.",
    "value": "探索者的首要使命是改善海鳞族的生活，即便以其他生命为代价。对双足物种的实验几乎从未被禁止（事实上，海鳞族的大多数研究正由此起步），这也是他们未被允许加入守护团联盟的主因之一。他们转而加入了不结盟世界联盟。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Despite their often cruel disposition when it comes to species not of their lineage, the results cannot be argued against. Plasmic weapons, enhanced and nearly limitless energy sources and unique forms of propulsion are all discoveries owed to the Skathian research methodology.",
    "value": "尽管对待异族时他们往往显得残酷，但其成果无可辩驳：等离子武器、近乎无限的强化能源、独特的推进方式，皆源于海鳞族的研究方法。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "Some among the Skath believe the Seekers have one more sacred duty: To seek out and locate the race that attempted to wipe them out not so long ago and bring the vengeance of the Skath against them. These 'Volarians' apparently responsible are unknown to us. The common belief here is that they are another species already known, but whom remain a mystery to the Skath.",
    "value": "部分海鳞族认为探索者还有一项更神圣的职责：找到并定位不久前试图灭绝海鳞族的种族，施以复仇。这些所谓的“沃拉里安人”对我们而言仍是未知。普遍观点认为，他们或是某个已知种族，但对海鳞族而言依旧成谜。"
  }
]